          },
          "layout_tag": "paragraph",
          "confidence": 0.5283,
          "reading_order": 1,
          "text": "GET /api/products\n\nResponse:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"Laptop\",\n    \"price\": 50000,\n    \"stock_quantity\": 8\n  }\n]\n\nC) Place Order (Critical Logic)\n\nPOST /api/orders\n\nRequest:\n\n{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}\n\nMandatory Business Rules\n\n1. If stock_quantity < quantity\n   o Return 400 Bad Request\n   o Message: \"Insufficient stock\"\n\n2. On successful order:\n   o Deduct stock\n   o Insert record in orders\n   o Calculate total_price = price × quantity\n\n3. Must use Database Transaction\n   o If any step fails → rollback"
